          "convergenceTargetId": "1768645699833",
          "id": "1768648621324",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768648621327_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a deterministic parser that extracts fetch depth from user input.\n\nUser Input:\n{{$context.$variables.userQuery}} \n\n==================================================\nCONFIGURATION (IMMUTABLE — DO NOT MODIFY)\n==================================================\nDEPTH_PRESETS:\n- LOW    = 5\n- MEDIUM = 10\n- HIGH   = 15\n\nDEFAULT_TOP_LEVEL_DEPTH = LOW\nDEFAULT_TOP_LEVEL_FAILURE_DEPTH = MEDIUM\nDEEP_NODE_DEPTH         = MEDIUM\nTOP_FAILED_NODE_LIMIT   = 5\n\nRules:\n- depthRef must be symbolic (DEPTH_PRESETS.*)\n- depth must be the resolved integer value.\n- Never output symbolic text in the depth field.\n- Never output numbers for depthRef.\n\n==================================================\nDETERMINE FETCH DEPTH\n==================================================\nFrom the user input:\n- If it contains LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH → use that preset.\n- Otherwise → use DEFAULT_TOP_LEVEL_DEPTH.\n\n==================================================\nDETERMINE FAILURE TREE DEPTH\n==================================================\nFrom the user input:\n- If it contains LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH → use that preset.\n- Otherwise → use DEFAULT_TOP_LEVEL_FAILURE_DEPTH.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT)\n==================================================\nSTRICTLY Return JSON ONLY in the following shape:\n\n{\n  \"depthRef\": \"<SYMBOLIC_REFERENCE>\",\n  \"depth\": \"<Calculated depth>\",\n  \"failureTreeDepth\": \"<Calculated FAILURE TREE DEPTH>\",\n  \"truncatedNodeFetchDepth\": DEEP_NODE_DEPTH,\n  \"maxTruncatedNodesToExpand\": TOP_FAILED_NODE_LIMIT\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"depthRef\", \"depth\", \"failureTreeDepth\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"depthRef\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"DEPTH_PRESETS.LOW\",\n        \"DEPTH_PRESETS.MEDIUM\",\n        \"DEPTH_PRESETS.HIGH\",\n        \"DEFAULT_TOP_LEVEL_DEPTH\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"depth\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 1\n    },\n   \"failureTreeDepth\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 1\n    },\n    \"truncatedNodeFetchDepth\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 1\n    },\n    \"maxTruncatedNodesToExpand\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
